                                        "entry_id": "17de30ee-d6a7-32ba-bae7-0b69b059c1d1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a way characterized by addition (of increments) rather than multiplication (by factors) or exponentiation (by exponents): by an arithmetic progression."
